    <small|<with|color|dark grey|The cross is <math|\<partial\><rsub|q>K<rsub|q>=1>, as before; with the two lines through it, it gives <math|<around|(|R<rsup|<around|[|3|]>><rsub|0,q>|)><rsup|2>>. The
